Package: EQuA
Type: Package
Title: Post-Hoc Quantile Calibration of Age Estimators
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-07-30
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Menghan",
        family = "Yi",
        email = "menghany@umich.edu",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides a pure-R reference implementation of Epigenetic Quantile
    Age (EQuA), a post-hoc quantile-calibration approach that transforms an
    existing scalar age estimate into individual quantile-age and
    quantile-age-acceleration profiles. Implements unconditional, endogenous
    kernel, and extended kernel formulations together with repeated
    cross-fitting and support diagnostics. Although motivated by epigenetic
    clocks, the framework applies whenever chronological age and an existing
    estimated age are available.
